  "credit": "@hunger_zest",
  "notes": "Speech is garbled and there are no amounts or labels: all amounts are my estimates. The video does not show how the raita curd is made (the voice says the full recipe is in the caption): the curd looks red-orange with small bits, like a chilli tadka, so I list only curd and a step to whisk it. The pale flour added after the carrot is besan by its look (it could be sattu). The grey powder is black salt by colour (could be black pepper), and the three brown powders (garam masala, cumin, coriander) are my guess from colour. Chickpeas are shown already boiled. Flame level and frying time are not shown."
 },
